| 8‑10 | Set up Instagram, TikTok, Shopify | Shopify store needs a payment gateway, tax settings, and privacy policy—each can take a day to configure correctly. |
| 11‑14 | Shoot 5 short videos | Lighting, sound, and editing can double the time estimate for a non‑professional. |
